<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's 10-day NCDs average yield at 6.246 pct.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's 10-day NCDs average yield at 6.246 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank issued T$5 billion in 10-day negotiable certificates of deposits on Monday at an average yield of 6.246 percent, a central bank official said.</p>
<p>The range of the bids was between 6.201 percent and 6.282 percent.</p>
<p>Demand totalled T$20.6 billion.</p>
<p>The central bank has said its recent series of NCD issues were aimed at absorbing extra liquidity in the banking system.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
